Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to\Nget help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you\Nsee Is beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way the best that we\Nknow. With tears and doubts and tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all want to go. The\Nhate within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am waiting for you, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am waiting for your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Far have I traveled to stand beside you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now in your moment of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight in your name I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Was able to speak with Zunisha\Nfor a moment at least. So you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,can talk to the elephant\NOdin predicted this years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're everything he dreamed\Nyou would be. You've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll lead this world to a new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still missing the most\Nimportant piece of this puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.18,0:02:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After reading Father's journal, I understand\Nthat I must survive no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he tore out the most\Nimportant page before I could see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The final island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Father and Roger see there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What made them laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I struggle to understand my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Father was not a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If he were here now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,would he still insist on opening\Nthe borders like he did before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have not the wisdom to solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If opening the borders puts\Nthe people of Wano in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then I do not want to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I a coward, Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Karat, get inside the dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have taken our revenge, but I fear\Nthe battle for Wano is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.13,0:04:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems this island could\Ncollapse at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We had better hurry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really put your life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting rough, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna reel you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're still alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not be dead, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad, really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole castle is about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hamlet, get us to the exit and hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to pressure you, but lives\Nare hanging in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's ever been a time\Nto deliver, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come for even\Nninja like you and I to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiery battle in the third-floor\Nhallway has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner, Ryzo of the Mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Gourmet of Sir\NLuffy's, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me aid you. You're\Nin no shape to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear You have done enough I must\Ntry I can't rest till the battle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.38,0:06:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is won I won't let you march to\Nyour own death Then I need a favor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,FINGER PISTOL
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,FINGER PISTOL!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,FINGER PISTOL!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this your plan, Izo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were going to sacrifice\Nyourself from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would a leftover from the Whitebeard\NPirates want to help those brats?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find Nico Robin quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Ndeal with this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an Imperial command\Nfrom the Five Elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,From the Five Elders?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They said, erase Straw\NHat Luffy immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you're asking of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is fighting\Nan Emperor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect me just to step into\Nthe middle of Kaido's fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The longer Strahan fights someone of\Nhis caliber, the greater the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Five Elders call it\Na necessary precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're worried about it,\Nthen we know the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very least, we don't\Nwant to find out. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, Link.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:09:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've accomplished nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with that crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes the Straw Hats so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mathieu, thank you so much\Nfor doing such a wonderful job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, boss! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You better get from the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A really big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Big Mom won't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you crying about, Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need Big Mom anymore\Nnow that you've got me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay close to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we can't relax just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is a bomb set to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I hope you can wrap this up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it's Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kurosaki, don't worry, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get out of this\Naccursed place soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be helping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the hold-up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard didn't run\Naway on his own, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A ninja must serve his lord till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone's gonna die, it should be HIM!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder who caused that\Nquake, Kanjuro, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope there's not more on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.78,0:11:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we're in danger why are you playing\Nmusic at a time like this are
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you listening to me stop this\Ninstant do you realize we're both
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,dead if we don't get help and here\Nyou are wearing that ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,mask you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,shown your face
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,once have Take off that mask! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Kurosaki, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed yet? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those little bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let her cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jacket Trafalgar 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we get ready? Kaido might\Ncome. That would be pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,just hope it's luffy who comes back for us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,my energy is all spent i gave this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,everything i had I can't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's rude to stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a mouth, don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So young.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be your first\Ntime teaming up with Rox.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll warn you, Rox is a good-for-nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't trust a word he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:15:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a problem, you bring it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Lin-Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm gonna be king of these\Nseas welcome to the team
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,looking back you and i have known each\Nother an awfully long time haven't we
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you old hack it's not fair why\Ndoes that have to happen now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We made a promise together, we\Nwere gonna get the one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Force gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a moment of silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a very emotional time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Read the damn room!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How careless of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You got so worked up that\Nyou didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki, why aren't you helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this damn rubble off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I transform?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have you using\Nyour power, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So I stuck a sea prism stone\Nnail in you to keep you docile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We were going to escape together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you don't love me anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I never loved you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite a coincidence that\Nyou like this piece so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called "Moon Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's beautiful, Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten so good at playing, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The song's called Moon Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try to get even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can play it at my funeral someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making your sister cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who made her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The funeral thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.01,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, it was only a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I die and leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.66,0:18:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My father loved this song as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How peculiar that you would have\Nthe same taste as Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, every time I play it,\NI remember my father's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, even as I avenge his\Ndeath, I dare not show a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a crap what\Nyou guys had planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of this country are starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.88,0:19:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You've taken enough from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving this Scorpio\Neverything that I have left!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop attacking\Nuntil I put an end to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell where these\Nattacks are coming from!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano doesn't need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kicking you out!
